      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹5.07 (vs ₹7.59 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹5.07 (down from ₹7.59 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹7.92b (down 28% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹2.01b (down 29% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 25% (in line with FY 2025). Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 10% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 8% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
